        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu dahosheliyi Yehova kukanwa kakaprofwetu Yeremiya dakutena Babiloni, dakutena niituŋa dawaKaladeya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mudi nakubuwabuwa wuswana wami, ochu chimunatiyi kuwaha, ninochu chimukuluŋa, ninochu chimukutaŋala neyi iyoŋa daŋombi wamu kaji wudi nakudatola matahu, ninochu chimukuhosha neyi atuwalu aŊovu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isarela himukoku wahaŋewa. Anamuhaŋi dehi kudi anyi tupa. Hakusambila amudiili kudi mwanta wakuAshuri. Ichi dinu kunu kukukuminina anamukotoli mafwahindi kudi mwanta wakuBabiloni, iwu Nebukaneza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehova wamazaza, Nzambi yaIsarela, nahoshi nindi, Tiyenu, nakababesha mwanta wakuBabiloni niituŋa dindi, neyi chinababeshi mwanta wakuAshuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isarela nakamuleta cheŋi kuwudiilu windi, wakadi ilaŋa haKarameli nahaBashani, wakekutilaŋa hamapidi aEfweremi niamuGileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Hamafuku owu nihampinji oyu kuluwa kwaIsarela akakukeŋakeŋa, hikwakekala kwokuku; ninshidi jaYuda nawa, hiyakayimonaku, muloŋa nakayanakena awa nakashiya nami ashaluhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamukilaku ituŋa daMeratayimi, nidena niashakama muPekodi Jahaku, yijilumuni chikupu mwakuyawu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. Ilaku mwejima munakuleji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwituŋa mudi ipumba danjita, nidakujilumuka kweneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musensi weseki dejima O chiwaketuka dehi, O chiwakotoka dehi! Babiloni O chelayi dehi kwachihembi hohu mukachi kanyuza! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Babiloni nakuti muhetu, wunafumu nawa, eyi aweni kuchiluka nehi. Anakuwani, anakukwati nawa, muloŋa wunalwishi naYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nenzululi dehi mwitala dindi dayitwa, nedishi dehi yitwa yakufwindashana kwindi. Muloŋa Mwanta, Yehova wamazaza, wudi namudimu mwituŋa dawaKaladeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fumenu kwakumina ŋinza mwinzi nakumunya mukila, mwenzululi mumatalindi akuswekela, muhumoni matalindi ekali kwanyilumba, mumujilumuni ji-i chikupu. Bayi hashala chuma chinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jahenu aŋombi jindi amayala, akunkumuki kwawu kuwujahilu. Yayo O yihuŋu yawu! Ifuku dawu dinashiki, yoyi mpinji yawu yakuyihempula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mazu anawa akutemuka, akupuluka mwituŋa daBabiloni, kulonda akashimuni muZiyona kutenda kwaYehova Nzambi yetu, kwakutenda tembeli yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutambikilenu Babiloni akwakwasa namata anyikunji, ejima evulaŋa mata anyikunji. Mutuŋilenu chilombu kwi-ndo, bayi hapuluka muntuku. Mulubwilenu yashikila munyidimu yindi; mwilenu yashikila muyuma yejima yaneliyi. Muloŋa yena nadinki wanta naYehova, naWajila waIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi anyikwenzi jindi akadimbukila munyikwakwa yindi, amayala indi akwanjita ejima akayimwenesha ifuku odu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova wamazaza nahoshi nindi, Tiya, eyi wadinka wanta, ami nakwimani mbe; muloŋa ifuku deyi dinashiki, yoyi mpinji yakukuhempula kudami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwakudinka wanta wakahukana wakadimbuka, kwosi wakamuhindwishaku. Nakabutula kesi munyikala yindi, kakalasha yuma yejima yamunyeŋumukaku kwi-ndo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nahoshi nindi, Nianyana kaIsarela, nianyana kaYuda anayikabishili hamu. Antu ejima ayikwatili muwukoli saŋa ayikakelawu mbe, kuyumbaku kwonti kwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkúuli yawu wudi naŋovu, ijina dindi diyi Yehova wamazaza. Wakahakula muloŋa wawu chachiwahi kulonda akanookeshi iseki, akabindaŋeshi ashakama muBabiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Mpoku yakabali yidi hadi aKaladeya, nihadi ashakama muBabiloni, nihadi atulamba twindi, nihadi antu indi akwamaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpoku yakabali yidi hadi akwakudisamba, akasuŋa. Mpoku yakabali yidi hadi ayilobu jindi, akakwata chikasa kukanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpoku yakabali yidi hatuwalu twawu, nihamakálu awu, nihadi antu ejima akwacheŋi adibombabomba adi mukachi kindi, akabalumuka neyi ambanda. Mpoku yakabali yidi hyuma yindi yalema, akayibuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chaaŋa chidi hameji indi, akoma chau. Muloŋa hiituŋa dawakishi akusoŋa, azalukila yuma yawu yakuyifwisha mutentu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi kwenoku kwakashakama anyama amwisaŋa nawatugwidi, mwakashakama nianyamalanda. Himwakashakama nawa cheŋi antuku haya nyaka. Mwamba kavwalikilaŋa makiŋu awantu mufwawa muvwalikawa himwamba katuŋa muntuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Chakisagenuwu Sodoma naGomora ninyikala yatuŋili kwakwihi nawena, dichi kwosi muntu wakashakama kwoku, hikwakazonkama hela mwana kamuntuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, kukabeta kakuchimunswa kudi nakwinza muza wawantu; muza weneni, nianyanta amavulu akayisaŋumuna akafuma kwakumina iseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakwata kumata anyikunji nikumayoŋa. Ankatu kwawu, hiyakweti wushonaku. Mazu awu abulumaŋa neyi kaluŋalwiji, endelaŋa hatuwalu, wejimawawu anatandami munyisululu munyisululu chochawantu adi nakuya kunjita, akadasi naneyi, eyi mwana kaBabiloni wamumbanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wakuBabiloni natiyi mpuhu yawu, nimakasa lehu. Yikatu yina muwani, ninyi soŋu yidi neyi ya mumba ndawu dina kufunyisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, wakakandukila kuwushakaminu wakola neyi chakandukaŋayi namutupa mwitu daYodana; ilaŋa ami nakamukasu mwisha, nakamutemuna akafumi kudi yena. Muntu atondawu diyi nakakunjika kwikala mwanta wawu. Ochu wudi neyi ami hinyi? Wakanholokela muchota hinyi? Kabiŋanyi wakemana kumesu ami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi tiyenu mpùŋa yaYehova yanakwatiliyi Babiloni, niyuma yanafu ukwiliyi ituŋa dawaKaladeya, nindi, Chalala akayitulumona nakuyitwala, wowu anyana ahamukanka wanyikoku. Chalala wakabalumuna hawushakaminu wawu hakekali kwayihembi nawena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
